    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1393" root="انق" body-key="A">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَنِيقٌ</span></b>  <i>Goodly,</i> or <i>beautiful;</i> (S, K;) <i>pleasing,</i>
or <i>rejoicing;</i> (JK, S, Msb, K;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَنَقٌ</span></b> :
(JK, TA:) and <i>loved.</i> (TA.) You say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَوْضَةٌ أَنِيقٌ</span>
<i>A meadow,</i> or <i>garden, that is loved:</i> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَوْضَةٌ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَنِيقَةٌ</span> <i>a meadow,</i> or <i>garden, that is pleasing,</i> or
<i>rejoicing.</i> (TA.)

